                if(!sys_ls(argv[1], 0, &print_location_y)){
                    check_print_location();
                    printf("No Such dir!\n");
                    print_location_y++;
                    continue;
                }
            }
```

**cat** (`test_shell.c:507-541`) — kernel fills a user buffer of `(30-15-1)*80+1 = 1121` bytes; shell splits on `'\n'`:
```c
